<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Affect</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>affect</a>
</pre>
<p>Type this to see what magic affects you: spells placed upon you by another
player or a creature (like bless or curse), the detect and raise spells,
poison, berserk and rage, and the like. It also tells you if you are hiding
or sneaking, and if the room you are in is sacred. You can't use it while
you are fighting.
</p><p>The magic of your equipment is not listed. If you are trying to train, a
teacher won't teach you while you are blessed or cursed, raging or
berserk, energy drained or raised by a spell, nor while your equipment raises an ability or a skill:
remove such equipment first. Spells you will have to wait to wear off, or
if you have signed the Book of Blood another player may be able to remove
them.
</p><p>See Also:
</p>
<pre> <a cmd='#'>Help dispel magic</a>
</pre>




</div>